  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ArenaHintZone
  title: ALERT GUARD AHEAD
  body: 'The guard ahead (4 attach points) is awake and faces you.

    A lone troop
    attacking from the front is countered and thrown back. Send 3 or more together,
    or lure it and go around to its back.

    If it reaches you, up to 4 enemies
    can attach to you from any direction.'
  radius: 4
